      "dcterms:title": "ON THE COMPUTATION OF THE DIFFERENCE GALOIS GROUPS OF ORDER THREE EQUATIONS",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "DREYFUS, THOMAS",
        "POULET, MARINA"
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20230705",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.13448",
      "dcterms:abstract": "In this paper we consider the problem of computing the diﬀere nce Galois groups of order three equations for a large class of diﬀerenc e operators including the shift operator (Case S), the q-diﬀerence operator (Case Q), the Mahler operator (Case M) a nd the elliptic case (Case E). We show that the general problem c an be reduced to several ancillary problems. We prove criteria to detect the irreduc ible and imprimitive Galois groups. Finally, we give a suﬃcient condition of diﬀerentia l transcendence of solutions of order three diﬀerence equations. We also compute the diﬀe rence Galois group of an equation suggested by Wadim Zudilin.",
